+B accepted all 24 outputs but had lower frozen completeness than A. Final repairs succeeded in one of three attempts for A, two of two for B, and zero of three for C. No agent met the combined target. Compiler context completed three additional A cases, one B case, and four C cases, without adding comparison/change claims. Disputed B judgments qualify its equality with C.
